{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-23T22:53:28.159Z","data":{"text":"Implemented the active-worktree retry path.\n\nKey changes:\n- `retry/find.rs` now lists trees once, finds active changes via `list_tree_changes` with git on or `list_changes` with git off, and carries the owning `ChangeTree`.\n- Added `retry/plan_edits.rs` plus its refusal text.\n- `retry.rs` checks plan edits for worktree changes and finishes in the change’s own tree.\n- `recertify.rs` loads config from the project root but runs verify and hashes scope in the tree root.\n- Added `tests/retry_active.rs` covering every active-worktree golden row, the `git mv` plan-edit refusal, and mutation-covering checkout/archived cases.\n- Copied the provided fixture and goldens unchanged into the crate.\n\nVerification passed:\n- `cargo test -p osq-feature-retry --test retry_active`\n- `OSQ_CHANGE=openspec/changes/324-rust-retry-active-worktree sh scripts/verify-rust.sh`\n- cargo-mutants on all changed retry source files: no missed mutants.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/324-rust-retry-active-worktree/.run/results/1.md`."}}
